            <ArticleTitle>Herpes zoster of the trigeminal nerve third branch: a case report and review of the literature.</ArticleTitle>
            <Pagination>
                <MedlinePgn>61-6</MedlinePgn>
            </Pagination>
            <Abstract>
                <AbstractText>LITERATURE REVIEW AND CASE REPORT: A literature review of Herpes zoster of the trigeminal nerve is presented. Included are differential diagnosis and treatment modalities that will enable the dental practitioner to identify and manage this disease. A case report is provided to amplify this timely information.</AbstractText>
            </Abstract>
